WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:05.830
Imber. Soon, I will release you
from that Master.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.080
She plans to drop the Imber?

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.580
With the inertial controls not working,
Haruka will be...!

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.750
She'd take the whole impact of her fall!

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.620
Haruka!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.870
I've heard the S.O.S.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.790
Have you finally heard it?

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.790
In a cutesy way

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:53.330
Impure or pure, which character?

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.160
Maybe they're the same

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.700
The love beat is opened up full throttle

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:03.700
I've noticed, this is a special mission... I've got it

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:10.080
I'll show you for real, because I'll make it come true

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:13.950
In a world that's pierced through the skies

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:20.910
I felt a strange emotion, I liked you in an instant!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.000
I'm sure I'll win with a smile

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.330
Sure enough a smile is the right way

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:34.870
I was small and crying but I'll rise to the challenge

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:37.250
I wonder what this palpitation is

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.540
I need a little medical attention

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:48.620
This feeling of slight fever
could be your fault, S.O.S!

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:02.040
I'm Home. Welcome Back.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.040
I swear, sir. You're so lewd!

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.250
Following that,

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.250
the Nebula's attack caused
the Nubilum to withdraw.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.910
The Imber and the Nebula
were both recovered here.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.250
So it was a draw, one could say?

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.830
Yes. But the real problem is,

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:21.000
why did they decide to launch
an operation like this NOW?

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:23.450
The Mischling...

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:28.080
There must have been some movement.
It's only natural to think that.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.330
The time has come for us strike, eh?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:35.370
No, they may be investigating
OUR movements.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:41.160
Difficult, isn't it? The maneuverings of love.
